    {
      "text": "Figure 5: Identified research clusters in the systematic literature review, illustrating Cluster I (Cognitive Psychology Theories, 16 studies), Cluster II (Cognitive Factors in Process Model Comprehension, 28 studies), and Cluster III (Cognitive Neuroscience Techniques, 3 studies).",
